# Every text file checks out with LF on every platform.
#
# The accessibility documents are generated with LF, and both
# `scripts/render_a11y_mapping.py --check` and
# `crates/curbcut-cli/tests/a11y_mapping.rs` compare the checked-out bytes
# against that output. A CRLF checkout would fail both, so the line ending is
# pinned here rather than left to `core.autocrlf`.
* text=auto eol=lf
